  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto announced major teacher initiatives, including international training, welfare payments, and digital learning studio launches.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto announced over 90 trillion rupiah in total welfare allowances dedicated to supporting teachers.",
    "The government introduced the Studio Guru platform for distance learning and committed to sending 3,350 teachers for international training starting in 2027.",
    "Official reports indicate an increase in certified teachers under the Ministry of Religious Affairs and the transition of 52,000 honorary staff to PPPK status."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "During the commemoration of National Teacher Day 2026 held in Bogor, President Prabowo Subianto detailed several strategic initiatives aimed at the Indonesian education sector. These updates include the formal launch of the Studio Guru program, designed to facilitate nationwide distance education. The administration also disclosed plans to provide specialized training for 3,350 teachers in Canada and Russia beginning in 2027. Furthermore, the government emphasized financial support, allocating more than 90 trillion rupiah toward teacher allowances and confirming the transition of 52,000 honorary employees into the government's PPPK employment scheme. These initiatives are being executed in collaboration with the Ministry of Primary and Secondary Education and the Ministry of Religious Affairs to address certification and professional development needs across the national education workforce.",
